[{"id":"smp-0aa71c667d44458ca38a171f509996e0","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":1,"repeat":1,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**抖音（剪映）素材库，不是全部都能直接商用，只有带「商」标识/筛选出【可商用】的素材，才可以商用，并且一般仅限抖音/剪映生态内使用**。\n\n## 两种素材区分\n✅ **可商用素材（带红色“商”标）**\n- 适用：企业号带货、广告投放、千川、本地推、接商单等盈利性质内容\n- 限制：**大多只允许在抖音、剪映体系内发布**；如果要导出放到公众号、视频号、线下宣传片、印刷物料等外部场景，要看授权协议，很多素材**不允许跨平台商用**\n\n❌ **普通免费素材（无“商”标）**\n- 仅允许：个人娱乐、非盈利自娱自乐\n- 禁止：企业宣传、带货、广告、付费课程等商用场景，哪怕账号没直接赚到钱，企业号发产品宣传视频也算商用，有版权索赔风险\n\n## 重点避坑\n1. **会员 ≠ 全部素材可商用**：剪映会员只是解锁更多素材，不等于自动获得商用授权，依旧要看「商」标识\n2. **抖音上别人发布的视频，不是平台素材库**：刷到普通用户发布的短视频，哪怕下载下来，**绝对不能拿来商用**，版权属于原作者\n3. **商用定义**：企业账号宣传产品、直播带货、广告投放、接商单、引流卖货，都属于商用\n\n## 快速操作方法\n打开剪映素材库，打开**可商用筛选开关**，只选用筛选结果里带“商”标的素材，发布前阅读素材详情里的许可协议。\n\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份商用素材授权范围的核对清单。","answerHash":"4567a1e889a5c987cf124da097112e681c6c55fe624e7ea1a8e2f2677b7bbabe","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"你是不是也以为充了剪映会员，然后所有的字体，音乐，素材都是可以随便用了？ 会员不等于可商用，免费也不等于可商用，大家还是多了解一下这方面的知识吧！一起避坑#剪映侵权 #字体侵权 #音乐侵权 #字体侵权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音用户服务协议 - 企业号帮助中心","url":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","normalizedUrl":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","domain":"renzheng.douyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音用户服务协议 - 企业号帮助中心","url":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/content/123619","normalizedUrl":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/content/123619","domain":"renzheng.douyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-1582724c6cfc4f719cb2f318c0c850c6","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**不是全部素材都能商用，只有带【可商用/红色“商”标识】的素材，才可以在限定范围内商用；普通免费素材只允许个人非娱乐使用，不能商用**。\n> 大家常说的抖音素材库，大多指**剪映素材库**（抖音剪辑同源素材），另外还有巨量即创素材库、抖音商用音乐库。\n\n## ✅ 可以商用的素材（剪映）\n素材卡片标有红色**商**字标识：图片、视频、音效、音乐、贴纸、字体，**可以商用**，但有两个重要限制：\n1. **授权范围：仅限抖音/剪映体系内使用**（抖音短视频、企业号带货、千川广告、本地推等）；\n2. **一般不能导出拿到其他平台使用**（视频号、B站、线下广告、印刷包装、宣传片、官网等，跨平台大概率侵权）。\n\n## ❌ 不带“商”标的素材\n免费素材、会员素材（**会员 ≠ 自动商用授权**）：\n仅个人娱乐、学习使用；**企业号带货、广告、卖货、接商单都属于商用，直接使用会版权投诉、索赔**。\n\n## 巨量即创素材库（千川/广告投放用）\n即创素材库内官方素材，**仅限巨量生态内投放广告（抖音、千川、本地推）商用**，不能脱离巨量体系对外使用。\n\n## 抖音商用音乐库（CML）\n专门给广告、企业营销配乐，里面音乐可以用于抖音商业内容；抖音普通背景音乐库**不支持商用**，企业带货视频不能随便用普通BGM。\n\n## 什么算商用（容易踩坑）\n企业账号、带货、接广告、付费课程、门店引流、投放DOU+/千川、用于产品宣传，**全部属于商用场景**，哪怕视频没有直接卖出去商品，也算商用。\n\n## 避坑要点\n1. 使用前**点开素材详情页，阅读许可协议**，确认授权范围；\n2. 商用优先筛选带【商】标识素材；\n3. 如果需要**跨平台、线下印刷、宣传片、官网**商用，剪映带“商”素材通常不满足，建议去独立商用图库（摄图、千库商用版等）购买完整授权；\n4. 素材里面有人物肖像，即使素材标可商用，也要留意肖像权风险。\n\n\n需要我给你整理一份快速判断素材是否可商用的核对清单吗？","answerHash":"93a1ba6fed427b314ef623ec746bb664f0a3056897a256c2ca50cb26ca87edf1","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"你是不是也以为充了剪映会员，然后所有的字体，音乐，素材都是可以随便用了？ 会员不等于可商用，免费也不等于可商用，大家还是多了解一下这方面的知识吧！一起避坑#剪映侵权 #字体侵权 #音乐侵权 #字体侵权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"哪些影视素材可以二次剪辑，中视频官方早给我们指明了方向#二创激励计划 #二创片单#抖音二创激励计划 #抖音二创片单#中视频影视剪辑","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7319848414127115560","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7319848414127115560","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音用户服务协议 - 企业号帮助中心","url":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","normalizedUrl":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","domain":"renzheng.douyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"h