bility-is-not-commercial-clearance.pdf","domain":"syncvaluations.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://aweme.snssdk.com/draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://aweme.snssdk.com/draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"aweme.snssdk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"关于商用音乐库","url":"https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/commercial-music-library?lang=zh","normalizedUrl":"https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/commercial-music-library?lang=zh","domain":"ads.tiktok.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-8712b9ce0a90460e9c0a18da40af97a5","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**不是全部素材都能直接商用，要看素材标识和使用范围（剪映/抖音内置素材库规则一致）**\n> 抖音素材库，一般就是剪映素材库。\n\n## ✅ 可以商用的素材\n素材上带有**红色“商”字标识**，代表版权方授权：\n- 可用于：企业号带货广告、千川投放、商单、付费内容等盈利场景\n- **限制：大多仅限在抖音/剪映生态内使用；把视频导出放到B站、小红书、线下广告、印刷物料等外部平台，很多会超出授权范围，有侵权风险**\n\n## ❌ 不能商用的素材（免费/会员素材，无“商”标）\n不带红色“商”标的图片、视频、音乐、贴纸、字体：\n- 仅允许**个人非商用娱乐**使用\n- 企业号带货、广告、卖货、接商单、变现，哪怕不直接收费，也算商用，容易收到版权投诉、下架、索赔\n\n## 巨量/即创素材库（千川广告素材库）\n里面官方素材一般**仅限巨量体系广告投放（抖音、千川、本地推）商用**，同样不能随便导出用于线下或其他平台。\n\n## 快速避坑要点\n1. 商用前，点开素材详情页，仔细阅读**授权说明**\n2. 会员 ≠ 自动可商用，会员只是解锁素材预览下载权限，不等于拿到商用授权\n3. 就算标了“可商用”，留意授权地域、期限、平台限制\n4. 商用定义：企业账号、带货、广告、引流卖货、商单、付费课程，都算商用\n\n","answerHash":"f3b53972326f3acf7e41394a4351803e72e7c0b4ed30f36eaa6c3f7dcd5ea1e8","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"你是不是也以为充了剪映会员，然后所有的字体，音乐，素材都是可以随便用了？ 会员不等于可商用，免费也不等于可商用，大家还是多了解一下这方面的知识吧！一起避坑#剪映侵权 #字体侵权 #音乐侵权 #字体侵权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音用户服务协议 - 企业号帮助中心","url":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","normalizedUrl":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/mobile/content/123619","domain":"renzheng.douyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#牛来 我就做个半分钟左右的切片，为啥不行啊✋","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675219413062570090","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7675219413062570090","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aHkUdcLjwpT9?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_daren","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-4e598ff86a9e486a9bd6bd575713dfcf","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":2,"repeat":1,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**不是全部素材都能直接商用，要看素材版权标记；抖音/剪映素材库只有标有【商】（可商用）标识的素材，才允许商用，并且大多仅限抖音/巨量体系内使用**。\n\n## 区分两种素材（剪映素材库，大家常说的抖音素材库）\n1. ✅ **带红色「商」标识**\n    授权范围：带货、企业号、广告、千川投放等商业内容。\n    限制：**一般仅限在抖音、巨量引擎、剪映生态内使用**；不能单独导出素材拿去印包装、线下广告、放到别的平台（B站、小红书、宣传片、印刷品等）商用，超出平台范围会侵权。\n\n2. ❌ **没有「商」标识（普通免费/会员素材、贴纸、普通背景音乐、特效字体）**\n    仅**个人非商用娱乐**，企业号带货、接商单、广告变现都属于商用，直接使用有版权投诉、索赔风险，就算开了剪映会员也不等于获得商用授权。\n\n> 商用定义：企业蓝V、带货、引流卖货、付费广告、商单接单、品牌宣传，都算商用。\n\n## 补充：抖音APP内音乐库\n普通背景音乐库**不能商用**；做广告、带货视频，要用**抖音商用音乐库**内的曲目。\n\n## 避坑要点\n1. 使用前，点开素材详情页，确认带有**商字标识**，阅读许可协议；\n2. 商用素材大多**仅限抖音生态内发布**，跨平台、线下物料、印刷包装要单独拿授权；\n3. 素材版权纠纷责任由使用方自行承担，平台不兜底。\n\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份快速自查清单，剪辑前快速判断素材能不能商用。","answerHash":"970d27adf99268ffb9a8bfd2365bfc417a45e0b67288b1f34a08e0bbe894c272","finishedAt":"2026-10-13","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"你是不是也以为充了剪映会员，然后所有的字体，音乐，素材都是可以随便用了？ 会员不等于可商用，免费也不等于可商用，大家还是多了解一下这方面的知识吧！一起避坑#剪映侵权 #字体侵权 #音乐侵权 #字体侵权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url