"normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-981ceb0fcbcb44c8bd4e5650264ef268","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":2,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**不是全部都能直接商用，要看素材标识与使用范围**（大家常说的抖音素材库，大多指剪映素材库）\n✅ **带红色「商」标识的素材**：可以商用，**仅限抖音/剪映生态内发布**（蓝V带货、千川广告、企业宣传、接商单都算商用）\n❌ **没有「商」标的普通素材、普通背景音乐**：**仅允许个人非娱乐使用，不能商用**。哪怕是企业号、带货视频、付费广告，直接用会有版权风险\n\n## 重要限制（很容易踩坑）\n1. **地域&平台限制**：带「商」的素材授权大多**仅限抖音生态**；把导出视频拿去发小红书、视频号、线下宣传片、印刷物料、官网等外部渠道，**超出授权范围，会侵权**\n2. **音乐单独区分**：抖音普通音乐库歌曲**不能商用**；做广告/带货视频，要用【商用音乐库】里的音乐\n3. **会员≠商用**：开通剪映会员，不等于库里所有素材自动获得商用授权，依旧要看有没有「商」标\n\n## 什么属于商用\n蓝V企业号内容、带货短视频、千川/DOU+广告、直播背景素材、接商单制作视频、付费课程等，都属于商业用途\n\n## 避坑建议\n1. 使用前点开素材详情页，确认**红色「商」标识**，阅读授权协议\n2. 商用尽量不要把素材原封不动直接成片，搭配原创内容二次加工\n3. 如果需要跨平台使用（视频号、线下、官网），优先选CC0、可全渠道商用的第三方素材\n\n","answerHash":"296134357771dae8e4e33a363bcac6193a67a8210fa9d5d0633b1e7a3dbf8f65","finishedAt":"2026-10-14","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"粉丝问答：素材音效能不能直接用？ #剪辑 #剪辑教程 #自学剪辑 #零基础学剪辑 #版权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694853351296519450","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694853351296519450","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"你是不是也以为充了剪映会员，然后所有的字体，音乐，素材都是可以随便用了？ 会员不等于可商用，免费也不等于可商用，大家还是多了解一下这方面的知识吧！一起避坑#剪映侵权 #字体侵权 #音乐侵权 #字体侵权","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660049083922548136","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com/obj/ies-hotsoon-draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"sf3-cdn-tos.douyinstatic.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"#新知识分享@DOU+小助手 @抖音小助手","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660339008110683258","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音用户服务协议 - 企业号帮助中心","url":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/content/123619","normalizedUrl":"https://renzheng.douyin.com/support/content/123619","domain":"renzheng.douyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商-学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJWWDTTvATTQ?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=ffl","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJWWDTTvATTQ?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=ffl","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"【素材库】抖店操作攻略","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHNPrrrnC1Pc?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=ed4c9266-b47d-485f-a0df-8bb01d764bb9","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHNPrrrnC1Pc?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=ed4c9266-b47d-485f-a0df-8bb01d764bb9","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"PLATFORM AVAILABILITY ≠ COMMERCIAL CLEARANCE","url":"https://syncvaluations.com/whitepaper/platform-availability-is-not-commercial-clearance/platform-availability-is-not-commercial-clearance.pdf","normalizedUrl":"https://syncvaluations.com/whitepaper/platform-availability-is-not-commercial-clearance/platform-availability-is-not-commercial-clearance.pdf","domain":"syncvaluations.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"“抖音”用户服务协议","url":"https://aweme.snssdk.com/draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","normalizedUrl":"https://aweme.snssdk.com/draft/douyin_agreement/agreements.html","domain":"aweme.snssdk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"关于商用音乐库","url":"https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/commercial-music-library?lang=zh","normalizedUrl":"https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/commercial-music-library?lang=zh","domain":"ads.tiktok.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-1a92be8b647c46f0ae4b142ef4e07da8","q":"CMCR-Q0097","question":"抖音素材库的素材可以直接商用吗？","day":2,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一句话结论\n**不是所有素材都能直接商用，要看素材标识和授权范围**（抖音/剪映是一套素材体系）\n> ✅ 带红色**“商”**标识的素材：可以商用，但**仅限抖音/巨量体系内使用**（抖音账号、千川广告、本地推等）；不能单独提取出来放到线下海报、官网、小红书、B站等外部渠道商用\n> ❌ 没有“商”标识的普通素材、普通背景音乐：**只允许个人非商用娱乐使用**，带货、广告、接商单、企业宣传都属于商用，直接用会版权侵权\n\n## 什么算商用？\n只要视频用于变现、品牌推广都算：\n- 抖音带货、企业号产品宣传、千川付费广告、本地推\n- 接商家商单、知识付费、引流卖服务\n\n## 重要避坑点\n1. **会员 ≠ 自动获得商用权**：剪映会员只是解锁更多素材预览下载，不带“商”字依然不能商用\n2. **商用范围受限**：就算是带“商”的素材，授权大多限定在抖音生态；拿到外部平台、印刷品、宣传片单独使用，不在授权内，会侵权\n3. **普通抖音热门BGM**：抖音自带音乐库大部分音乐**不能用于商业广告**，商业投放要用【商用音乐库】里的音乐\n\n## 快速判断步骤\n1. 在剪映素材库，查看素材卡片有没有红色**商**标\n2. 点开素材详情，阅读《素材使用许可协议》\n3. 保留授权截图，作为维权凭证\n4. 跨平台/线下使用，不要依赖这套素材，改用全平台可商用素材库\n\n","answerHash":"25abd5bdbd5c82f07465e7f607419154ed7a27df3c9fb684f6c227111dba4137","finishedAt":"2026-10-14","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"抖音电商学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr9Aqg?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_author","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"网络素材如何避免侵权？ #抖来普法2025 #深度理性计划 #文化传媒 #企业法律顾问","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","normalizedUrl":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7562099467718561066","domain":"www.iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音素材不可乱用，小心掉坑！","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7588958429662783138","norma